---
// Footer.astro - RERA Compliance, Brand Credentials & Strategic Keyword Silo
import { mahindraPuneProjects, corporateProfile } from '../data/mahindraPuneEcosystem';
import { allMahindraKeywordPermutations } from '../data/mahindraKeywordsEcosystem';
---

<footer class="bg-[#0c1017] border-t border-white/10 pt-16 pb-28 sm:pb-20 text-stone-300 text-xs relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle ambient glow background -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-gold-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Top Brand & Links Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 pb-12 border-b border-white/10">
      
      <!-- Col 1: Developer Legacy -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <div>
          <img 
            src="/images/mahindra-lifespaces-logo.svg" 
            alt="Mahindra Lifespaces Developers Limited" 
            class="h-5 w-auto object-contain mb-2"
            width="230"
            height="16"
          />
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-red"></span>
            <span class="font-serif text-xs tracking-widest text-gold-400 font-semibold uppercase">
              Mahindra Rivenza • Baner Annex, Pune
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-stone-300 text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          A landmark ~13.46-acre master community at Baner Annex / Mahalunge, West Pune. Featuring 9+ acres of landscaped greens, ~44,000 sq.ft clubhouses, and 2, 3 & 4 BHK luxury residences starting ₹90 Lakhs*.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-2">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-[10px] text-stone-200 font-medium">75+ Years Group Legacy</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-[10px] text-stone-200 font-medium">NSE: {corporateProfile.nseSymbol} • BSE: {corporateProfile.bseCode}</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-[10px] text-stone-200 font-medium">Pre-Certified IGBC Gold & Net Zero Waste</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Quick Links -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-serif text-stone-100 tracking-wider uppercase text-[11px] font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold-400"></span>
          The Project
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5">
          <li><a href="/#overview" class="text-stone-300 hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Master Vision</a></li>
          <li><a href="/residences/" class="text-stone-300 hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Residences Hub (13 Typologies)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#masterplan" class="text-stone-300 hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Interactive Master Plan</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#amenities" class="text-stone-300 hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Curated Amenities</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#pricing" class="text-stone-300 hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Price & Expressions</a></li>
          <li><a href="/brochure/" class="text-stone-300 hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Download Brochure PDF</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tools/" class="text-stone-300 hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Financial Calculators (Stamp Duty &amp; EMI)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/web-stories/" class="text-stone-300 hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500"></span>Google Web Stories (Pune Real Estate)</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Location Hubs -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-serif text-stone-100 tracking-wider uppercase text-[11px] font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold-400"></span>
          Location & Growth
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5">
          <li><a href="/mahalunge-pune/" class="text-stone-300 hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Why Mahalunge</a></li>
          <li><a href="/west-pune/" class="text-stone-300 hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">West Pune Market Hub (12 Localities)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/flats-near-hinjewadi/" class="text-stone-300 hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Flats Near Hinjewadi</a></li>
          <li><a href="/flats-near-baner/" class="text-stone-300 hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Flats Near Baner</a></li>
          <li><a href="/nande-mahalunge-real-estate/" class="text-stone-300 hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Nande Corridor Analysis</a></li>
          <li><a href="/articles/" class="text-stone-300 hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Research & Guides Hub</a></li>
          <li><a href="/faq/" class="text-stone-300 hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Official FAQs</a></li>
          <li><a href="/brand/" class="text-stone-300 hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Mahindra Pune Ecosystem</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 4: Sales Office & Inquiries -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-serif text-stone-100 tracking-wider uppercase text-[11px] font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold-400"></span>
          Project Desk
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-2 text-stone-200">Mahindra Rivenza, Baner Annex, off Baner-Hinjawadi Road, Pune - 412115</p>
        <p class="mb-1 text-stone-300">Desk: <a href="tel:+917744009295" class="text-gold-400 hover:underline font-semibold">+91 7744009295</a></p>
        <p class="mb-3 text-stone-300">Official Inquiries: <a href="mailto:info@mahindralifespaceshomes.in" class="text-gold-400 hover:underline font-medium">info@mahindralifespaceshomes.in</a></p>
        <button
          data-open-modal
          data-interest="Request Callback"
          class="btn-shimmer inline-block py-2 px-4 rounded-lg bg-gold-500/15 hover:bg-gold-500 border border-gold-500/40 text-gold-300 hover:text-charcoal-950 text-[11px] tracking-wider uppercase font-bold transition-all shadow-sm"
        >
          Request Official Callback
        </button>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- STRATEGIC SEO KEYWORD SILO & PUNE ECOSYSTEM NETWORK -->
    <div class="py-10 border-b border-white/10 space-y-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
        <h4 class="font-serif text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-400 font-bold">
          Mahindra Lifespaces Pune Ecosystem & Topical Directory
        </h4>
        <span class="text-[10px] text-stone-400 font-mono">
          Corporate CIN: {corporateProfile.cin} • 6 Landmark Pune Communities
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-[11px]">
        
        <!-- Silo 1: Entire Pune Projects — deep-linked to brand project pages -->
        <div class="space-y-2.5">
          <h5 class="font-serif text-stone-200 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[10px] border-b border-white/10 pb-1">
            Mahindra Pune Portfolio
          </h5>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-stone-400">
            {mahindraPuneProjects.map((p) => (
              <li>
                <a href={`/brand/projects/${p.slug}/`} class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors flex items-center justify-between">
                  <span class="truncate">{p.name}</span>
                  <span class="text-[9px] text-stone-300 font-mono ml-1">{p.deliveryYear.split(' ')[0]}</span>
                </a>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <a href="/brand/" class="text-[10px] text-gold-400/70 hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors block pt-0.5">
            View Full Brand Portfolio →
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Silo 2: Typologies & Configurations — expanded with new pages -->
        <div class="space-y-2.5">
          <h5 class="font-serif text-stone-200 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[10px] border-b border-white/10 pb-1">
            Residences & Typologies
          </h5>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-stone-400">
            <li><a href="/residences/2-bhk/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">2 BHK Optima Suite (785–895 sq.ft.)</a></li>
            <li><a href="/residences/2-bhk-premium/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">2 BHK Premium with Study Alcove</a></li>
            <li><a href="/residences/3-bhk/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">3 BHK Luxe (1,120–1,210 sq.ft.)</a></li>
            <li><a href="/residences/3-bhk-signature/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">3 BHK Signature Family Layout</a></li>
            <li><a href="/residences/4-bhk/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">4 BHK Signature Estate</a></li>
            <li><a href="/residences/4-bhk-penthouse/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">4 BHK Penthouse Collection</a></li>
            <li><a href="/residences/vastu-compliant/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">Vastu-Compliant Residences</a></li>
            <li><a href="/residences/north-east-facing/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">North-East Facing Units</a></li>
            <li><a href="/residences/nri-investment/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">NRI Investment Guide</a></li>
            <li><a href="/residences/affordable-luxury/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">Affordable Luxury Entry</a></li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/residences/" class="text-[10px] text-gold-400/70 hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors block pt-0.5">
            View All 13 Typologies & Plans →
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Silo 3: Tech Park Proximity Hubs -->
        <div class="space-y-2.5">
          <h5 class="font-serif text-stone-200 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[10px] border-b border-white/10 pb-1">
            Tech Park Commute Hubs
          </h5>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-stone-400">
            <li><a href="/near/flats-near-infosys-hinjewadi/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">Flats Near Infosys Hinjewadi (7 mins)</a></li>
            <li><a href="/near/flats-near-wipro-circle-hinjewadi/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">Flats Near Wipro Circle (6 mins)</a></li>
            <li><a href="/near/flats-near-tcs-sahyadri-park-hinjewadi/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">Flats Near TCS Sahyadri Park (12 mins)</a></li>
            <li><a href="/near/flats-near-eon-free-zone-kharadi/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">Flats Near EON Free Zone Kharadi</a></li>
            <li><a href="/near/flats-near-world-trade-center-pune/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">Flats Near WTC Pune (Kharadi)</a></li>
            <li><a href="/near/flats-near-panchshil-business-park-baner/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">Flats Near Panchshil Business Park Baner</a></li>
            <li><a href="/near/flats-near-balewadi-high-street/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">Flats Near Balewadi High Street</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Silo 4: Infrastructure & Comparisons — expanded -->
        <div class="space-y-2.5">
          <h5 class="font-serif text-stone-200 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[10px] border-b border-white/10 pb-1">
            Corridors & Comparisons
          </h5>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-stone-400">
            <li><a href="/connectivity/flats-near-pune-metro-line-3-hinjewadi/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">Pune Metro Line 3 Hinjewadi-Shivajinagar</a></li>
            <li><a href="/connectivity/flats-near-sant-tukaram-metro-station/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">Sant Tukaram Metro Station</a></li>
            <li><a href="/connectivity/properties-on-pmrda-36m-ring-road/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">PMRDA 36m Town Planning Ring Road</a></li>
            <li><a href="/connectivity/properties-near-pune-ring-road-western-alignment/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">Pune Outer Ring Road Western Alignment</a></li>
            <li><a href="/connectivity/flats-near-mumbai-pune-expressway-access-point/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">Mumbai-Pune Expressway Access</a></li>
            <li><a href="/compare/mahindra-mahalunge-vs-megapolis-hinjewadi/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">vs Megapolis Hinjewadi</a></li>
            <li><a href="/compare/mahindra-mahalunge-vs-kolte-patil-24k-majestic/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">vs Kolte Patil 24K Majestic</a></li>
            <li><a href="/compare/mahindra-mahalunge-vs-godrej-hillside/" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">vs Godrej Hillside Comparison</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>


      <!-- Strategic Keyword Cloud Tag Strip (Tucked Behind Collapsible Drawer) -->
      <details class="group pt-4 border-t border-white/5 list-none">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer select-none py-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 font-mono hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold-400 group-open:animate-ping"></span>
            <span>Strategic Search Intent Permutations:</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-gold-400 text-xs font-bold group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300">▼</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-3">
          {allMahindraKeywordPermutations.slice(0, 32).map((term) => (
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/[0.03] text-[10px] text-stone-400 font-mono border border-white/5 hover:text-gold-300 hover:border-gold-500/20 transition-colors">
              {term}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <!-- MahaRERA Compliance Notice Box -->
    <div class="mt-10 p-6 rounded-xl glass-card border border-white/10 space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-stone-100 font-medium">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gold-400 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0zm-7-4a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zM9 9a1 1 0 000 2v3a1 1 0 001 1h1a1 1 0 100-2v-3a1 1 0 00-1-1H9z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="tracking-wider uppercase text-[11px] font-serif text-gold-300 font-bold">Statutory Disclosure & MahaRERA Compliance Advisory</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-stone-300 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Official MahaRERA Registration:</strong> "Mahindra Rivenza" is a project being developed by Mahindra Lifespace Developers Limited in a phase wise manner. The project is registered with MahaRERA as <strong>Mahindra Rivenza Phase 1</strong> bearing registration no. <span class="text-gold-300 font-mono font-semibold">PR1261012602102</span> valid upto 30/12/31 and <strong>Mahindra Rivenza Phase 2</strong> bearing registration no. <span class="text-gold-300 font-mono font-semibold">PM1261012602103</span> valid upto 30/12/31 available on <a href="https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-gold-400 underline hover:text-gold-300">https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in</a>.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-stone-300 leading-relaxed">
        The information contained herein is indicative of the kind of development that is proposed. All amenities and specifications of the Project will be as per the agreement to be executed between the parties. Buyer Discretion advised. Site address: Mahindra Rivenza, Baner Annex, off Baner-Hinjawadi Road, Pune, Maharashtra 412115.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Copyright -->
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-stone-300 text-[11px]">
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Mahindra Rivenza Showcase. All rights reserved.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 mt-4 sm:mt-0">
        <a href="/sitemap/" class="hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors text-gold-300">HTML Sitemap</a>
        <a href="/sitemap.xml" target="_blank" class="hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">XML Sitemap Index</a>
        <a href="/#disclaimer" class="hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/#disclaimer" class="hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Terms of Use</a>
        <a href="https://www.mahindralifespaces.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Official mahindralifespaces.com ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
